    (id: "s1098", spell: 1098, name: "Enslave Demon", rank: "Rank 1", icon: "Spell_Shadow_EnslaveDemon", school: 5, mechanic: 1, level: 30, base_level: 30, max_level: 43, cost: 300, gcd: 1500, attributes: 1073807360, family: 5, family_flags: 2048, cast: 3000, range: 30.0, duration: 300000, reagents: [(6265, 1)], effects: [(kind: 6, aura: 6, low: 32, high: 32, per_level: 1.0, targets: (6, 0)), (kind: 6, aura: 138, low: -40, high: -40, targets: (6, 0)), (kind: 6, aura: 65, low: -30, high: -30, targets: (6, 0))], text: "Enslaves the target demon, up to level 32, forcing it to do your bidding.  While enslaved, the time between the demon's attacks is increased by 40% and its casting speed is slowed by 30%.  Lasts up to 5 min.  If you repeatedly enslave the same demon, it will become more difficult to control with each attempt."),
