    (id: "s5998", spell: 5998, name: "Pester", icon: "Spell_Shadow_VampiricAura", attributes: 262400, range: 100.0, effects: [(kind: 36, trigger: 4739)], text: "Allows a hunter to teach his tamed bird the Pester ability. Pester greatly increases the attack speed of the bird at the cost of dealing less damage. Every successful attack while in this mode renders the target unable to cast spells for a short time.\nRequires: \nPet Level 36+"),
