    (id: "s28270", spell: 28270, name: "Polymorph: Cow", icon: "Spell_Nature_Polymorph_Cow", school: 6, mechanic: 17, dispel: 1, level: 60, base_level: 60, cost: 150, gcd: 1500, attributes: 1074855936, family: 3, family_flags: 3238264832, cast: 1500, range: 30.0, duration: 50000, effects: [(kind: 6, aura: 5, targets: (6, 0)), (kind: 6, aura: 56, low: 1, high: 1, misc: 16779, targets: (6, 0)), (kind: 108, low: 10, high: 10, misc: 21, targets: (6, 0))], text: "Transforms the enemy into a cow, forcing it to wander around for up to 50 sec.  While wandering, the cow cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form.  Only one target can be polymorphed at a time.  Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters."),
